// Compatibility recovery and protection
"Could not save the cache backup. Nothing written." = "无法保存缓存备份，未写入系统缓存。";
"Compatibility" = "兼容";
"Compatibility protection" = "兼容保护";
"Sound / black screen recovery" = "声音 / 黑屏兼容恢复";
"Restore saved original SDK" = "恢复已保存的原始 SDK";
"Remove compatibility protection" = "解除兼容保护";
"The recorded SDK already matches the installed app. Compatibility protection is enabled; no cache write is needed." = "当前 SDK 记录已经与安装程序一致，已启用兼容保护，无需写入缓存。若仍有静音或黑屏，请分享该应用的诊断信息。";
"For sound lost after Notification Center, Control Center, folding or unfolding, or an app that opens to a black screen: recover its compiled SDK, tap Apply, then restart. This removes forced adaptation for this app and protects it from Select all. It does not patch the app's audio or rendering code." = "下拉通知中心、控制中心、合盖或展开后无声，或应用启动黑屏时：找回该应用的原始 SDK，点“应用”并重启手机。这会撤销该应用的强制适配，并防止“全选”再次启用。兼容恢复不会修改该应用内部的音频或画面代码。";
"%@ changed since the list was loaded. Reload before applying. Nothing written." = "载入列表后，%@ 的安装记录已变更。请刷新列表后重试，本次未写入。";
"An app is no longer installed. Reload before applying. Nothing written." = "要修改的应用已不在安装列表中。请刷新列表，本次未写入。";
"The app was updated during recovery. Reload and try again." = "恢复过程中应用已更新。请刷新列表后重试。";
"The cache changed while it was being read. Reload and try again." = "系统缓存在读取时发生变化。请刷新列表后重试。";
"Diagnostics saved in Files → On My iPhone → Force Duo → Diagnostics." = "诊断已保存。前往“文件”→“我的 iPhone”→“Force Duo”→“Diagnostics”查看。";
"Removing compatibility protection keeps the pending restore. Turn the app back on to cancel it." = "解除兼容保护后，待恢复操作仍会保留。重新打开此应用的开关可取消恢复。";
"Restore only this app for the sound test" = "仅恢复此应用，测试声音";
"For the sound test, restore only this app to turn off its forced adaptation. Restart the phone, then test unfolding and Notification Center separately." = "恢复后，此应用会退出强制适配。请重启手机，再分别测试翻开切到内屏和下拉、收起通知中心后的声音。";
"The app record changed. Refresh and try the single-app restore again." = "应用记录发生变化。请刷新列表后重新尝试单独恢复。";
"Restart the iPhone Duo, then test unfolding in the game and opening and dismissing Notification Center separately." = "请重启 iPhone Duo，再分别测试游戏切到内屏，以及下拉并收起通知中心后的声音。";
"Test SDK 27.0 for this app only" = "仅对此应用试用 SDK 27.0";
"SDK 27.0 may leave the game at its original size. Restoring the original SDK removes forced enlargement for this game." = "SDK 27.0 可能让游戏保持原尺寸。恢复原始 SDK 会取消这款游戏的强制放大。";
"This app is not eligible for the SDK 27.0 test. Refresh the app list and check its original SDK." = "此应用无法试用 SDK 27.0。请刷新列表并确认原始 SDK。";

"Duplicate app records found. Refresh the list before continuing." = "发现重复的应用记录。请刷新列表后再继续。";
